{"id":335,"type":"vertex","label":"hoverResult","result":{"contents":{"kind":"markdown","value":"\n```rust\nalloc::vec::Vec\n```\n\n```rust\nimpl<T, A> Vec<T, A>\npub const fn len(&self) -> usize\nwhere\n    // Bounds from impl:\n    A: Allocator,\n```\n\n---\n\nReturns the number of elements in the vector, also referred to\nas its 'length'.\n\n# Examples\n\n```rust\nlet a = vec![1, 2, 3];\nassert_eq!(a.len(), 3);\n```"}}}
