{"id":399,"type":"vertex","label":"hoverResult","result":{"contents":{"kind":"markdown","value":"\n```rust\ncore::option::Option\n```\n\n```rust\nimpl<T> Option<T>\npub const fn unwrap_or(self, default: T) -> T\nwhere\n    T: Destruct,\n```\n\n---\n\nReturns the contained [`Some`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/core/option/enum.Option.html#variant.Some) value or a provided default.\n\nArguments passed to `unwrap_or` are eagerly evaluated; if you are passing\nthe result of a function call, it is recommended to use [`unwrap_or_else`],\nwhich is lazily evaluated.\n\n# Examples\n\n```rust\nassert_eq!(Some(\"car\").unwrap_or(\"bike\"), \"car\");\nassert_eq!(None.unwrap_or(\"bike\"), \"bike\");\n```\n\n[`unwrap_or_else`]: https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/core/option/enum.Option.html#method.unwrap_or_else"}}}
