{"id":412,"type":"vertex","label":"hoverResult","result":{"contents":{"kind":"markdown","value":"\n```rust\ncore::option::Option\n```\n\n```rust\nimpl<T> Option<&T>\npub const fn copied(self) -> Option<T>\nwhere\n    T: Copy,\n```\n\n---\n\nMaps an `Option<&T>` to an `Option<T>` by copying the contents of the\noption.\n\n# Examples\n\n```rust\nlet x = 12;\nlet opt_x = Some(&x);\nassert_eq!(opt_x, Some(&12));\nlet copied = opt_x.copied();\nassert_eq!(copied, Some(12));\n```"}}}
